00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:58.700
which is the suppressive repertoire,

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:03.230
the strategies by the Burmese
military, the Tatmadaw

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:08.980
in terms of engineering and
provoking public hostility

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:13.580
against the popular urban
pro-democracy movement

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:16.953
during military rule
between 1988 and 2010.

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:23.410
This talk it will proceed as follows.

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:28.400
So, first of all, I will
discuss a little bit

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:32.700
in terms of the existing scholarship,

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:37.700
as well as the existing
reports and research

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:44.360
on the Burmese military
junta suppression of defense.

00:04:46.355 --> 00:04:51.355
And via this brief, the
review, I would hope to show

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:58.840
that most of this existing
studies on this particular topic,

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:02.290
they have focused on analyzing

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:07.290
the more straightforward tools
of repression by the junta.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:11.740
However, there is a gap in
terms of the understanding

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:16.740
